                      "height": 76.75,
                      "content": "inPowered AI is the leading sell-side AI decisioning platform. The company’s AI models run directly on the exchange, enabling agencies and brands to deliver better outcomes through real-time, impression-level decisioning. The company is backed by strategic investors and industry operators and is at the forefront of enabling intelligence on the sell-side.",
